    "faq_iHzKiM": {
      "type": "faq",
      "blocks": {
        "item_7MLK8k": {
          "type": "item",
          "settings": {
            "title": "What is ALTAÏ Second Wind?",
            "content": "<p>ALTAÏ Second Wind is a liquid dietary supplement for adult men. It combines botanical extracts and minerals in a dropper format—a simple option if you prefer not to swallow capsules.</p>"
          }
        },
        "item_2jJr6V": {
          "type": "item",
          "settings": {
            "title": "How soon will I notice a difference?",
            "content": "<p>There’s no guaranteed timeline or result. Individual responses can vary, and some people may not notice a difference. Follow the label directions, and remember that your purchase comes with a 90-day money-back guarantee, subject to its terms.</p>"
          }
        },
        "item_CqTLQO": {
          "type": "item",
          "settings": {
            "title": "Why drops instead of capsules?",
            "content": "<p>The main difference is how you take them. ALTAÏ comes as drops taken under the tongue, so there are no capsules to swallow. A liquid format does not, by itself, guarantee faster or better results.</p>"
          }
        },
        "item_gjEzw9": {
          "type": "item",
          "settings": {
            "title": "How do I take ALTAÏ?",
            "content": "<p>ALTAÏ is taken under the tongue using the included dropper. Follow the directions on your bottle for the serving size and frequency. Do not exceed the recommended amount.</p>"
          }
        },
        "item_2LooXH": {
          "type": "item",
          "settings": {
            "title": "How long does one bottle last?",
            "content": "<p>Each 60 mL bottle contains 30 servings of 2 mL. At one serving per day, that would be a 30-day supply. Always follow the usage directions on your bottle.</p>"
          }
        },
        "item_jbiX4v": {
          "type": "item",
          "settings": {
            "title": "What’s inside the formula?",
            "content": "<p>The formula includes Tongkat Ali, Shilajit, Fadogia agrestis, Ashwagandha, magnesium, zinc, Ajuga turkestanica, boron citrate, and a botanical blend.</p><p>The liquid base contains organic glycerin, purified water, citric acid, and natural flavors. See the Supplement Facts section for the amounts and full ingredient list.</p>"
          }
        },
        "item_j81ys0": {
          "type": "item",
          "settings": {
            "title": "Is ALTAÏ testosterone or a prescription medication?",
            "content": "<p>No. ALTAÏ is a dietary supplement, and its formula does not contain testosterone. It is not a prescription medication or a replacement for treatment recommended by your healthcare professional.</p>"
          }
        },
        "item_vd4GOw": {
          "type": "item",
          "settings": {
            "title": "Can I take it with medication or other supplements?",
            "content": "<p>Check with your doctor or pharmacist before use, and show them the full ingredient list. Supplements can interact with medicines and with each other. Do not stop or change a prescribed treatment to take ALTAÏ. <a href=\"https://www.fda.gov/consumers/consumer-updates/fda-101-dietary-supplements\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"FDA guidance\">FDA guidance</a>.</p>"
          }
        },
        "item_6hBOEk": {
          "type": "item",
          "settings": {
            "title": "Are there any side effects?",
            "content": "<p>Side effects are possible, and “natural” does not mean risk-free. Ashwagandha can cause stomach upset or drowsiness, and rare cases of liver injury have been reported with ashwagandha supplements. <a href=\"https://www.nccih.nih.gov/health/ashwagandha\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"NIH information\">NIH information</a>.</p><p>Read the warnings on your bottle. If you experience an unwanted reaction, stop use and seek medical advice.</p>"
          }
        },
        "item_rtSfjL": {
          "type": "item",
          "settings": {
            "title": "What if ALTAÏ isn’t right for me?",
            "content": "<p>ALTAÏ comes with a 90-day money-back guarantee. Please review the guarantee terms for eligibility, any return requirements, and how to request a refund.</p>"
          }
        },
        "item_BDUmW3": {
          "type": "item",
          "settings": {
            "title": "Will my order arrive discreetly?",
            "content": "<p>Yes. Your order ships in plain, discreet packaging, so the outer parcel doesn’t advertise what’s inside.</p>"
          }
        },
        "item_KcvExt": {
          "type": "item",
          "settings": {
            "title": "Can I buy ALTAÏ for my partner?",
            "content": "<p>Yes. Reading the ingredients and directions together is a good place to start. Choosing whether to use it should be his decision.</p>"
          }
        }
      },
